* The email service is unavailable.
* A recipient address is invalid.
* A template fails to render.
* A dynamic variable is missing.
* An email sends twice.
* A status update succeeds but delivery fails.
* The same status is submitted twice.
* A signing link expires.

An email failure must not silently corrupt the application status.

A failed email must not cause a valid fee confirmation or decision to disappear.

Use safe retry behavior and clear administrative visibility.

Do not log signing tokens or other secrets.

