PHASE 12 — MOVE-IN READINESS AND JOURNEY COMPLETION

The audit must continue beyond lease signing.

Determine which requirements must be complete before the platform represents the household as ready to move in.

Inspect:

* Fully executed lease.
* Confirmed holding-deposit credit.
* Confirmed remaining move-in costs, as applicable.
* Required security-deposit record.
* Rent and lease dates.
* Property availability.
* Required applicant or signer completion.
* Move-in instructions.
* Key handover or access instructions, if part of the existing workflow.
* Final confirmation messages.
* Internal administrative status.

Do not introduce a new service or invent a new move-in process.

Document which of these requirements already exist and which are missing.

Make the final status unambiguous. “Approved,” “Lease signed,” “Move-in ready,” and “Moved in” are not interchangeable.

